    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{3}{4}$ of a pizza each.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\frac{1}{4}\\div3&=\\frac{9}{4}\\div3\\\\&=\\frac{9}{4}\\times\\frac{1}{3}\\\\&=\\frac{9}{12}\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\end{align*}$$\nEach friend receives $\\frac{3}{4}$ of a pizza.",
